  "body": "There is no validation on the aliases listed on an m.room.aliases event, so it is possible to list things which aren't valid aliases at all, or which would be valid aliases, but are on a different server:\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"type\": \"m.room.aliases\",\r\n  \"state_key\": \"matrix.org\",\r\n  \"content\": {\r\n    \"aliases\": [\r\n      \"random jakj # 2342 !\",\r\n      \"#foo:sw1v.org\"\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nBoth of these currently confuse riot-web at least.\r\n\r\nRelated: matrix-org/matrix-spec#176, matrix-org/matrix-spec#533 ",
